window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The seelie I used to be in love with followed me on my quest for the Goddess…and demanded that I mate with him when he realized said quest required me to tie myself down again. </b><br> <br> Our world has changed so much, so quickly.<br> <br> And to top it off, the goddess is about to change everything again.<br> <br> <i>Through me. </i><br> <br> But I have to take a mate to survive it, and my only option seems to be the gorgeous man I thought rejected me 20 years ago.<br> <br> Only he thinks <i>I</i> rejected <i>him</i>.<br> <br> So, while we're dealing with Vevol's many new threats, we're also dealing with our past baggage, and a mating bond neither of us was quite ready for.<br> <br> Everything in our world is on the line…and if we can't make it work between us, I don't know if <i>anyone</i> will survive. </p> <p><i>*This is the sixth and final book in a series of steamy connected standalones. Humor and happily-ever-after guaranteed.</i></p>"; 
